  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.13.0 - HeatMap and CalendarHeatMap gain CellGap and RowGap for spacing between cells and rows, and HeatMapPalette (Green, Blue, Purple, Heat, Grayscale presets or custom colors) with glyph or solid-tile coloring. Defaults leave existing output unchanged. Includes interactive example pages, a --heatmap-once snapshot, and shared regression tests. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
